 "internal_silences": [],
 "text": "Good morning, everyone. Today I want to talk about a simple habit that helps me every day. Each morning, I take a short walk before work. The walk is not long, and it is not fast. I leave my phone at home so that I can look around. I notice the trees, the birds and the light on the street. When I come back, my mind feels clear. I find it easier to plan the day and to start the first task. You do not need special shoes or a big park. A quiet street is enough. Try it for one week, and see what changes for you."
}